# This folder is published as a PUBLIC GitHub repo (owner, 12 Nov 2026: "Yes, public repo").
# Only the daily sync and site-build code and their inputs are published (site code: owner, 12 Nov 2026, "Yes"). Everything else (plans, research, logs,
# tests with advert excerpts, discovery data, job data) stays on the owner's PC.
# Allow-list: ignore everything at the top level, then let through what the sync needs.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/sync/
!/site/
!/wrangler.jsonc
!/config.json
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/README.md
!/data/
/data/*
!/data/employers.json
!/data/blocklist.json
